-- IC Maps data backup. Does not include the schema.
-- Excluded: user, session, account, verification, my_maps, my_maps_collaborator,
-- my_maps_node, my_map_polygon, my_map_edge, my_map_line, my_map_point, my_map_text,
-- my_map_arrow, and spatial_ref_sys.
-- Routes, favorite trips, and favorite buildings are included. Their user_id values are kept.
-- The account rows those ids point at are not in this file, so a route row restores only
-- when that user still exists.
-- accessibility_report is not in this database, so it is not here.
-- Restoring replaces only the tables truncated below. Accounts and My Maps are left alone.
-- psql "$DATABASE_URL" -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 -f data/map-backup.sql
